Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:02:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 25/27] Music: Ice Mountain area for Alone

Only Lumbridge had a music_modern area, so tracks such as Alone (also an easy clue music step)
never unlocked. Adds area.ice_mountain from the OSRS Wiki's Map:Alone polygon (modern mode; the
Black Knights' Fortress hole is not modelled).
---
